        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: పర్యావరణం",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పర్యావరణం — paryāvaraṇaṁ — \"the environment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పర్యావరణం కోసం ప్లాస్టిక్ వాడకం తగ్గించాలి. paryāvaraṇaṁ kōsaṁ plāsṭik vāḍakaṁ taggiñcāli. For the sake of the environment we should use less plastic."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పర్యావరణ, environmental, before a noun: పర్యావరణ దినోత్సవం, Environment Day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పర్యావరణం (paryāvaraṇaṁ) is a modern Telugu word built from Sanskrit pari, \"around\", and āvaraṇa, \"a covering, an enclosure\" (Monier-Williams): what surrounds and covers us."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
