              "text": "Past (I …): నష్టపరిచాను, naṣṭaparicānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నష్టం, a loss, + -పరచు, to cause: to cause a loss. The same -పరచు makes other verbs from nouns."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నష్టపరచు (naṣṭaparacu) is a Telugu verb built from నష్టం, \"a loss\", borrowed from Sanskrit naṣṭa, \"lost, destroyed\" (Monier-Williams), and the native -పరచు, the causative of పడు, which DEDR 3853 lists as paṟacu, \"to cause to feel or suffer\"."
            }
